          "check_bonus": "-3",
          "defense_type": "DEF",
          "detail": "<p>On hit, inflicts <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Zombie.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.RZIAnKw95vY6yh2W]{Zombie}&nbsp;</strong>for <strong>3</strong> round, if the target is already afflicted with <strong>Zombie</strong>, increase the duration by <strong>3</strong> round.</p>\n<p>Increase the Accuracy of this attack by <strong>【Duration of <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Zombie.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.RZIAnKw95vY6yh2W]{Zombie}】</strong>on target.</p>",
