          "$deleted": false,
          "ailments": "",
          "ailments_chance": "0",
          "attrib_1": "DEX",
          "attrib_2": "MIG",
          "basic_name": "🏹 Zombie Chuck",
          "check_bonus": "3",
          "defense_type": "DEF",
          "detail": "<p>This attack can only be used if at least <strong>1 Zombie</strong> on the battlefield.</p>\n<p>On hit, if the target is <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/14_SMN/summon_garuda_II.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw]{Flying}</strong> it immediately landed until the start of next round, then, the <strong>Zombie</strong> can perform a <strong>Free Attack</strong> on the target.</p>",
